=================== PART 1: direction isolation ===================
RDMA_WRITE: the CLIENT reads its local buffer and writes into the SERVER's buffer.
  GPU on client only  -> NIC READS FROM GPU
  GPU on server only  -> NIC WRITES INTO GPU
